::: {.cell-output-display}
![Changes (days/year) in predicted dates of first adult emergence for PTLM across the CONUS over the recent 24-year period (2001–2025). Maps show (A) all changes and (B) statistically significant changes (P < 0.1); areas shown in gray are not statistically significant.](figure3.png){#fig-ptlm-emergence-recent fig-align='center' width=70%}
:::
:::



::: {.cell layout-align="center"}
